  m_text: 'A shader computes each pixel from its inputs. Lit reads the lights and the camera''s position. The other shaders read other inputs, and some ignore the lights.


    <b>Predict:</b> You will move the Spot Light, then move the camera, then only wait. Which of the five objects change each time?


    <b>Try:</b> Move "Spot Light - move me" in the Scene view. Then orbit the Scene camera around the objects and move close to D. Then press Play and wait.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Shader library, all stations</color></size>'
