  m_text: 'A shader is written for one render pipeline. These materials use the Built-in pipeline''s Standard shader, from an old download. URP cannot run it.


    <b>Predict:</b> Why are these objects drawn magenta? What does a converter have to change in each material?


    <b>Try:</b> Open Window > Rendering > Render Pipeline Converter. Keep Built-in as the source and Universal Render Pipeline (Universal Renderer) as the target, tick Material Shader Converter, press Scan, then Convert Assets. Then select a material in Old-Download and read its Shader.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Exercises/Fix-The-Pink</color></size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
